{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36284","headline":"题龙泉寺绝顶 · 方干","name":"题龙泉寺绝顶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未明先见海底日，良久远鸡方报晨。\n古树含风长带雨，寒岩四月始知春。\n中天气爽星河近，下界时丰雷雨匀。\n前後登临思无尽，年年改换去来人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《三体唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三體唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}